        "description": {
          "text": "Updated labeling with final Overall Survival data from PALOMA-3 for palbociclib plus fulvestrant in HR+, HER2-negative advanced/metastatic breast cancer after prior endocrine therapy",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for updates to the Prescribing Information based on the final Overall Survival data for study A5481023 (PALOMA-3) which evaluated the efficacy and safety of palbociclib plus fulvestrant (with or without goserelin) vs. placebo plus fulvestrant (with or without goserelin) in pre/peri and postmenopausal women with HR+, HER2-negative advanced or metastatic breast cancer whose disease progressed following prior endocrine therapy.",
